He sailed the seas for years, couldn't amount to anything, amassed an army of losers,

268
00:18:55,630 --> 00:19:01,150
and in the end was even stabbed by one of his own sons who put more stock in my word than his own.

269
00:19:01,730 --> 00:19:04,630
And still, he'll die to protect that man.

270
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:07,930
Have you ever heard of a more pathetic life?

271
