274
00:19:18,390 --> 00:19:18,830
Ace!

275
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:21,550
You're wrong.

276
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:25,130
There's nothing fake about the family he gave us.

277
00:19:25,130 --> 00:19:29,610
But I wouldn't expect a heartless bastard like you to appreciate that.

278
00:19:30,690 --> 00:19:34,290
Like I said, he convinced you, Punx, you meant something to the world.

279
00:19:34,970 --> 00:19:37,410
But your kind doesn't deserve a halt.

280
00:19:37,730 --> 00:19:39,090
You deserve the gallows.

281
