283
00:19:41,670 --> 00:19:43,050
You'll all die as failures.

284
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:46,050
And Whitebeard's nothing but a lonely old fool.

285
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:48,950
Whitebeard is the greatest pirate who ever lived, you hear me?

286
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:56,670
You don't know anything about the man who saved my life!

287
00:19:56,890 --> 00:19:58,610
Get away from the base!

288
00:19:58,610 --> 00:20:00,350
This is his era!

289
00:20:00,730 --> 00:20:01,970
Don't you forget it!

290
00:20:13,130 --> 00:20:16,550
Your pops will end up the same as you, boy.

291
00:20:16,970 --> 00:20:19,230
Dead and by my hand!

292
00:20:26,010 --> 00:20:26,690
How?

293
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:27,750
Did he burn him?

294
00:20:28,610 --> 00:20:36,650
Thanks to your Logia-type fruit, you're not used to being hurt.

295
00:20:37,010 --> 00:20:38,450
It's made you too cocky.

296
00:20:39,170 --> 00:20:44,050
You may be made of fire, but my magma burns even hotter than that.

297
00:20:44,530 --> 00:20:46,210
Just like Whitebeard.

298
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:48,550
