Jesus!

303
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:01,310
Please just be regard!

304
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:08,170
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, and Dragon the Revolutionary.

305
00:21:08,170 --> 00:21:12,410
To think that the two of you were adopted brothers all these years.

306
00:21:13,410 --> 00:21:16,510
What a victory it be to end both bloodlines.

307
00:21:16,970 --> 00:21:18,450
Everyone else can escape.

308
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:21,130
The two of you are the only targets I'm after.

309
00:21:21,130 --> 00:21:24,130
Say goodbye.

310
00:21:27,130 --> 00:21:28,130
Pwish!

311
00:21:30,130 --> 00:21:31,130
Opie!

312
00:21:51,130 --> 00:21:54,130
Which gods get the stars together.

313
00:21:57,130 --> 00:22:03,130
แRC accompanied by by the various people.

314
00:22:03,130 --> 00:22:10,130
It has been spiritual beings and time to increase the chances combine with the Kes 아 2050s.

315
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:15,130
It can blend perfectly quickly and uninkles.

316
00:22:15,130 --> 00:22:18,130
Experience.

317
00:22:18,130 --> 00:22:28,710
This is definitely a VIVRA card, but there's something I neglected to tell you before.

318
00:22:29,310 --> 00:22:31,870
The life force of the owner is also reflected on the paper.

319
00:22:32,770 --> 00:22:35,150
Does this belong to someone close to you?

320
00:22:36,450 --> 00:22:38,570
Yeah! It's my big brother's!

321
00:22:39,570 --> 00:22:42,090
Now you hang on to that, always.

322
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:46,570
That scrap of paper is going to reunite us someday.

323
00:22:48,130 --> 00:23:15,750
Ace protects his brother from Aka-Inu, but suffers a mortal blow in the process.

324
00:23:15,750 --> 00:23:21,010
Jinbei and the Whitebeard Pirates rush to his aid, but soon realize he is far beyond help.

325
00:23:21,310 --> 00:23:25,350
As Ace takes his final breaths, he gives a heartfelt message to his comrades.

326
00:23:25,910 --> 00:23:31,690
On the next One Piece, looking for the answer, Firefist Ace dies on the battlefield.

327
00:23:32,330 --> 00:23:34,070
I'm going to be king of the pirates!

